Isa 37:1 , Hezekiah mourning, sends to Isaiah to pray for them;
Isa 37:6 , Isaiah comforts them;
Isa 37:8 , Sennacherib, going to encounter Tirhakah, sends a blasphemous letter to Hezekiah;
Isa 37:14 , Hezekiah's prayer;
Isa 37:21 , Isaiah's prophecy of the pride and destruction of Sennacherib, and the good of Zion;
Isa 37:36 , An angel slays the Assyrians;
Isa 37:37 , Sennacherib is slain at Nineveh by his own sons.
